{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1793554252,"nonce":"dVfaZZPyQ/a5nHIh4jmtLpy2BsI=","message":"Audit 2026-11-01: what is still decided in Rust rather than by rules.\n\nColour picked from ColorToken at build time:\n- overlay panels: dialog, drawer, sheet, popover, hover_card, tooltip, and the select/combobox list (.bg/.border inline although .cn-*-content rules exist); dropdown_menu, context_menu, menubar, navigation_menu.\n- disclosure: accordion, collapsible, tree, breadcrumb, tabs (trigger text colour is a computed), pagination (active text).\n- display: card and table header text, kbd, avatar (status dot, fallback fill), progress (track/indicator via style!), spinner, skeleton, separator, resizable handle, slider (track/fill/thumb, disabled look), toast, input/textarea error and description text, chart (canvas paint).\n- fallbacks behind override setters: icon, scroll_area, avatar.\n- core widgets: table, link, blockquote, list, hr, code editor, rich_text_editor, media controls.\n- dead code: ButtonVariant::{background,base_background,foreground,border} are no longer called.\n\nMotion defined in Rust instead of CSS transition/@keyframes with --duration-*/--ease-*:\n- spinner rotation (1000 ms timeline), skeleton pulse (1500 ms).\n- tabs panel enter/exit, dialog/sheet/drawer and core overlay presets, toast tray (300 ms EaseOutCubic): MultiKeyframeAnimation.\n- accordion, collapsible, tree expand and sidebar collapse: springs and animate_bounds.\n- slider thumb and progress fill: springs.\nNot style: scroll bounce physics, text_input long-press timing, toast auto-dismiss timeout, media timing.\n\nEvery CSS transition/animation in CN_STYLES and UA_STYLES already uses the duration/ease tokens.","files":null}]}